<title>UK: United News' TSMS to launch new media unit.</title>
<headline>United News' TSMS to launch new media unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSMS, the UK media sales house owned by United News &amp; Media Plc, on Friday said it is launching a new unit devoted to sales and marketing of new media.</p>
<p>TSMS Interactive is to be launched next Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's got potential for the whole interactive market,&quot; a spokesman for TSMS told Reuters. He declined to provide further details ahead of the Thursday press launch.</p>
